# Local dataset clone and derived image mirrors. `data/rmsnow` is ~53 GB of
# full-resolution PNGs pulled from the HF dataset; a bare `git add -A` would
# otherwise stage all of it. Mirrors built by scripts/build_image_cache.py live
# outside the repo (~/rmdig-cache-<size>) but are ignored here too in case
# someone points --out at the worktree.
data/
rmdig-cache-*/
.leak_probe.py
